            "id": 78425,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie heißt die Zählervariable in diesem Code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es gibt keine Zählvariable im Code</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>i</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du benennst die Zählervariable von <code>i</code> in <code>step</code> um. Durch welche Änderung funktioniert die Schleife weiterhin gleich?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ersetze <code>i</code> überall durch <code>step</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ersetze <code>i</code> nur in der ersten Zeile.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ersetze <code>i</code> nur in der Bedingung und Aktualisierung.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ersetze <code>i</code> überall durch <code>step</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Code: Counter variable",
            "id": 78990,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verwende die <code>counter</code>-Variable, um die Bedingung auf weniger als <code>11</code> festzulegen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating payroll&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>while</code>, gefolgt von <code>counter</code> und schließlich <code>&lt;</code>, <code>11</code>, <code>:</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib <code>Updating payroll</code> genau achtmal aus und stoppe dann. Setze <code>counter</code> links in den Vergleich.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating payroll&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>while</code>, gefolgt von <code>counter</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>11</code> und schließlich <code>:</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing the counter",
            "id": 78415,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>2</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>So wie er geschrieben ist, zeigt dieser Code <code>2</code> an. Welche einzelne Änderung würde stattdessen <code>4</code> anzeigen?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ändere die Bedingung zu <code>counter &lt; 4</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ändere <code>counter += 1</code> zu <code>counter += 4</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ändere <code>counter = 1</code> zu <code>counter = 0</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ändere die Bedingung zu <code>counter &lt; 4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Changing the counter variable",
            "id": 78417,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die Zahlen <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> und <code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Zahlen <code>1</code>, <code>2</code> und <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die Zahlen <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>2</code> und <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die Zahlen <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> und <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Diese Schleife zeigt <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> und <code>2</code> an, wie die Konsole zeigt. Was würde sie tun, wenn du die Zeile <code>counter += 1</code> löschst?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sie würde <code>0</code> immer wieder anzeigen, ohne zu stoppen.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sie würde <code>0</code> einmal anzeigen und dann stoppen.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sie würde weiterhin <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> und <code>2</code> anzeigen.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sie würde <code>0</code> immer wieder anzeigen, ohne zu stoppen.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Condition",
            "id": 78419,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige die Zahl <code>1</code> bis <code>3</code> an, indem du die Bedingung auf <code>number &lt;= 3</code> setzt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(number)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  number += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>&lt;=</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib <code>1</code> bis einschließlich <code>3</code> aus. Wähle den Operator, mit dem die Schleife bis einschließlich <code>3</code> läuft.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(number)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  number += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>&lt;=</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Incrementing",
            "id": 79150,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge innerhalb des Codeblocks der <code>for</code>-Schleife mit dem <code>+=</code>-Operator <code>~</code> zur <code>line</code>-Variable hinzu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;*&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += \" /><text value=\"&quot;~&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(line)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"*\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~~\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>+=</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: i counter",
            "id": 79145,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Variable ist die Zählvariable der <code>for</code>-Schleife?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += i\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(line)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>line</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>i</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Werte enthalten <code>i</code> und <code>line</code> am Ende der dritten Wiederholung?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += i\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(line)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code> ist <code>2</code> und <code>line</code> ist <code>3</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code> ist <code>3</code> und <code>line</code> ist <code>3</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code> ist <code>2</code> und <code>line</code> ist <code>2</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i</code> ist <code>2</code> und <code>line</code> ist <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 79144,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie heißt die Zählervariable in diesem Code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Zero to four:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" repetition \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(repetition)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Zero to four:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>repetition</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Null bis fünf:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>repetition</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Konsole unten zeigt, was dieser Code so, wie er ist, anzeigt.</p><p>Nimm nun an, der Schleifenkopf wäre <code>for step in range(5):</code>, die Ausgabezeile würde aber weiterhin <code>repetition</code> verwenden. Was würde Python tun?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Zero to four:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" repetition \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(repetition)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Zero to four:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Python meldet einen Fehler, weil <code>repetition</code> nicht mehr der Name der Zählervariable ist.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Schleife zeigt weiterhin die Zahlen von <code>0</code> bis <code>4</code> an.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die Schleife zeigt fünfmal das Wort <code>step</code> an.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Python meldet einen Fehler, weil <code>repetition</code> nicht mehr der Name der Zählervariable ist.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: For keyword",
            "id": 79152,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Polly wants a cracker!</code> dreimal</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Zahlen <code>1</code> bis <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die Zahlen <code>0</code> bis <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Polly wants a cracker!</code> dreimal.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Schleife unten wiederholt sich dreimal. Welchen Wert hat <code>i</code> während der dritten und letzten Wiederholung?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nichts, weil der Schleifenkörper <code>i</code> nie verwendet</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>2</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
